    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Corpses Have Arrived!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Update! New Corpses Have Arrived!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/b778728a4979829445ee439d9c6ebd00.avif?t=1753052896\" width=660 height=256 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/8c1652b38d553904eee60d448ae6070f.poster.avif?t=1753052896\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/8c1652b38d553904eee60d448ae6070f.webm?t=1753052896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/8c1652b38d553904eee60d448ae6070f.mp4?t=1753052896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return a corpse to life and battle endless enemies with it. Grow stronger as you level up and obtain additional skills. Focus on not dying, but surely, it will happen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just try again! Improving your corpses as you go inside of the last corpse forge of this ethereal space. Unlock additional relics and torches to add different combinations of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > [ Beat the game : Unlock The Halls of Infinity! - Infinite Timed Game Mode. ]</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/8c1652b38d553904eee60d448ae6070f.poster.avif?t=1753052896\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/8c1652b38d553904eee60d448ae6070f.webm?t=1753052896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422130/extras/8c1652b38d553904eee60d448ae6070f.mp4?t=1753052896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return a corpse to life and battle endless enemies with it. Grow stronger as you level up and obtain additional skills. Focus on not dying, but surely, it will happen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just try again! Improving your corpses as you go inside of the last corpse forge of this ethereal space. Unlock additional relics and torches to add different combinations of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > [ Beat the game : Unlock The Halls of Infinity! - Infinite Timed Game Mode. ]</p>",
